From f263f17e1aac6827b2282d00f5c18e2c3a8d4b74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fpskianet <fpistonesi@webeasytech.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:00:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Windows port: ConPTY backend

Pty_win replaces kpty/kprocess with the Windows pseudo console (ConPTY). Win32 branches in Session, History, BlockArray, Screen (UTF-16 surrogate pairs as extended characters), Emulation (16-bit extended-char hash), konsole_wcwidth, tools and qtermwidget (translation paths); CMake builds without kpty/utempter on Windows.
